        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "As my father walked into the room, my brother cowered slightly（轻微地畏缩）. He sensed that he had done something 37 . I could see that he had 38 my father’s new hymnal and scribbled（乱涂）in it. Now he was waiting for his punishment."
